codex
Both types are opaque to public C consumers and contain no pointer fields or nested resources. Their allocators return zeroed `av_malloc` storage released by `av_free`. I’ll reuse the existing ffibox heap policy and add constructors and exclusive reinitialization methods. Twofish also needs length checks that preserve C’s key-bit truncation and padding status.
